=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to the frontier station in {z:Foret de Hennetiel} or {z:Morimar Basalt Fields} and speak with the {n:Station Worker}.
* You will be presented with a list of various emotes from which you must choose one to cheer up the worker.
* To complete the assignment, the correct emote must be chosen while facing the {n:Station Worker} and the direction listed below. (If the directions say East, you need to be both facing the worker and facing east, not standing east of the Worker)
** It is far easier to line up facing the correct direction using first-person view. (V Key by default on Keyboard.) Locking onto the NPC can also help.
** After each emote attempt, a dialogue will inform you whether the direction or emote was correct.
** Directions are approximate; take a few steps to the left or right if the angle is incorrect.
* The correct emote/direction changes approximately every 3 game hours, so it is possible to warp back and forth from the {p:Mummers' Coalition} and rapidly repeat this quest once you figure out the proper emote/direction.

|^Time|Foret de Hennetiel|Morimar Basalt
|00:00-03:00|Look pleased (NW)|Cheer (N)
|03:00-06:00|Cry a River (N)|Pretend to be flustered (NE)
|06:00-09:00|Act Surprised (NE)|Blush like a Maiden (E)
|09:00-12:00|Rue your life (E)|Rally the troops (SE)
|12:00-15:00|Cheer (SE)|Look Pleased (S)
|15:00-18:00|Pretend to be flustered (S)|Cry a river (SW)
|18:00-21:00|Blush like a maiden (SW)|Act surprised (W)
|21:00-00:00|Rally the troops (W)|Rue your life (NW)

